[4.450, "o", "\r\u001b[14B\u001b[49m\u001b[K### resetting to a single revision at 100% traffic (clean baseline)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[33mWarning:\u001b[C\u001b[0mKubernetes default value is insecure, Knative may default this to secure in a future release: spec.template.spec.containe\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[23;130Hers[0].securityContext.allowPrivilegeEscalation, spec.template.spec.containers[0].securityContext.capabilities, spec.template.spec.\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[24;130H.containers[0].securityContext.runAsNonRoot, spec.template.spec.containers[0].securityContext.seccompProfile\r\n\u001b[Kservice.serving.knative.dev/knative-demo-app patched (no change)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### waiting for a clean idle baseline (scale-to-zero, up to ~30s)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kpods running: 0\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### starting port-forward to kourier-internal\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### firing 15 concurrent workers for 25s -- watch the top pane scale out\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kt+5s: pods running: 2\r\n\u001b[Kt+10s: pods running: 2\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[7;130H"]
